      "title": "🎫 Parks Canada pass",
      "content": "Required for everyone staying in Banff National Park, car or not. $12.25 per adult per day, valid until 4 PM the next day. Four daily passes ($98 for two) cover Dec 21 to 25. One pass covers every spot in the park; the hot springs and gondola charge separately."
    },
    {
      "title": "🚌 Getting around (Roam Transit)",
      "content": "Roam Transit runs from Banff Ave. Route 8X to Lake Louise ($10 pp each way). Route 1 to the gondola and hot springs. Route 9 to Johnston Canyon runs weekends and stat holidays only in winter."
    },
    {
      "title": "🌡 Weather to expect",
      "content": "Days: -5 to -15 C, colder with wind chill\nDaylight: Sunrise ~8:30 AM, sunset ~4:30 PM"
    },
    {
      "title": "🎄 Holiday notes",
      "content": "Dec 24 and 25 have reduced transit and shuttle schedules, and restaurants run holiday menus. Book dinners and confirm shuttle times ahead."
    },
